{244}{I'm so very sorry about your friend, but such are the casualties of business. Now!  For your information.  Our records down here are very extensive, but it might take hours to find what we're looking for.  I have a better way.  We shall ask my father, Pelonious Schuyler.}{I'm so very sorry about your friend, but such are the casualties of business. Now!  For your information.  Our records down here are very extensive, but it might take hours to find what we're looking for.  I have a better way.  We shall ask my father, Pelonious Schuyler.}{}{}{}{ru 2037, gf2345 1}
