{5}{These men...they were the men who killed my brother, Lawrence.  [He looks around at them, almost with pity.]  I had come here tonight to confront my past, once and for all.  I knew that it would most certainly lead to my own death, but I just couldn't run from it any longer...}{These men...they were the men who killed my brother, Lawrence.  [He looks around at them, almost with pity.]  I had come here tonight to confront my past, once and for all.  I knew that it would most certainly lead to my own death, but I just couldn't run from it any longer...}{}{2}{}{}
