{9}{Yes...it no longer holds any power over me.  [He takes a deep breath.]  Before I met you, before I met Joachim, I was very different.  I was a criminal, really, an evil man...there's no other way to say it, and I don't mind admitting it to you now...}{Yes...it no longer holds any power over me.  [He takes a deep breath.]  Before I met you, before I met Joachim, I was very different.  I was a criminal, really, an evil man...there's no other way to say it, and I don't mind admitting it to you now...}{}{3}{}{}
