{15}{My family moved to Caladon when I was younger.  Lawrence and I were close in our early years, but the life I chose to lead as I grew older was repulsive to him, and we finally had a falling out.  At the time, I didn't care...the dead have no family, and remember not their pasts...}{My family moved to Caladon when I was younger.  Lawrence and I were close in our early years, but the life I chose to lead as I grew older was repulsive to him, and we finally had a falling out.  At the time, I didn't care...the dead have no family, and remember not their pasts...}{}{5}{}{}
