{24}{I can't tell you the pain which tore open my very soul when I found Lawrence, bleeding and broken, the life gone out of him.  I cursed myself, and the gods, and everything else I had forsaken, and I ran.  I ran so far and so fast that I don't remember anything until I woke up on the doorstep of the Panarii temple where Joachim took me in...}{I can't tell you the pain which tore open my very soul when I found Lawrence, bleeding and broken, the life gone out of him.  I cursed myself, and the gods, and everything else I had forsaken, and I ran.  I ran so far and so fast that I don't remember anything until I woke up on the doorstep of the Panarii temple where Joachim took me in...}{}{8}{}{}
